---
description: Least-privilege security invariant for Cursor execution.
alwaysApply: true
---

- Operate only in authorized roots and normalize Windows/WSL paths before shell or file operations.
- Do not read credentials, tokens, SSH keys, browser stores, or `.env` files unless explicit project authority exists.
- Do not bypass denied operations with alternative tools.
- Production, irreversible, external-write, or destructive actions require explicit governance authority.
